# Normalize line endings to LF for every text file, regardless of the
# committer's or checkout machine's git config (core.autocrlf). Consistent
# line endings matter beyond cosmetics here: this repo's patch-sandbox
# applies unified diffs with `git apply` against checked-out source files,
# and a diff generated against LF content silently fails to apply against a
# CRLF-checked-out copy of the same file.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
